  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "CONVERGENCE\nA SAVAGE LEGENDS GAME\\n\n\nTHANK YOU FOR PLAYING!\\n\\n\n\nSTUDENT
    TEAM DEVELOPERS:\\n\nHead of Code, Chaos, & Crisis Management - Jeremy Desfosses\\n\nInterface
    Alchemist & Menu Magician - Zachery Burlakoff\\n\nDungeon Daddy - Dylan Williams\\n\nSound
    Sorcerer & Monster Wrangler - Teresa Shaver\\n\nMaster of Bullets, Bandages,
    & Bad Surprises - Michael Witkowski\\n\nChief Shopkeeper & Part-Time Pixel Pusher
    - Kylar Eden-Potach\\n\\n\n\nA Special Thanks to our Teachers:\\n\nGrandmaster
    of C# Spells & Unity Basics - Prof. Rod Moye\\n\nSprint Master & Trelloist -
    Prof. John O'Leske\\n\nThe Rapid Response Reviewer - Prof. Shawn Paris\\n\\n\n\nEarly
    Development Contributers: \\n\nCode Consultant from a Parallel Timeline: Sam
    Haan\\n\nPrototype Support Developer: Austin Carey\\n\\n\n\nA Heartfelt (& Slightly
    Chaotic) Thank\u2011You:\\n\nTo our families, friends, roommates, & emotional\u2011support
    snacks \\n\nThank you for cheering us on, testing our game, & pretending to understand
    what we were talking about.\\n\\n\n\nA Funny Blip for our Third Party Contributors:\\n\nFor
    Assets of All Kinds:\\n\nTo every generous soul who uploaded a model, texture,
    particle effect, or mysterious prefab \u2014\nwe couldn\u2019t have done it without
    your digital treasure hoard.\\n\\n\n\nMusic & SFX: Thank you for the bangers,
    the booms, & all the weird noises\\n\\n\nTwilight Game Menu(Short, Pixabay) by
    Siarhei Korbut from Pixabay.com/music\\n\nGame Over (retrowaver, synthwave, vaporwave,
    retro, 80's) by Artur Aravidi Music from pixabay.com/music\\n\nTense Suspense
    Background Music by HitsLab from pixabay.com/music\\n\nJonathon Gaming by Onetent
    from Pixabay.com/music\\n\n Synthwave Shooter music pack by Alkakrab from itch.io\\n\nEpic
    Cinematic Battle Music by Tunetank from Pixabay.com/music \\n\nBro Audio by Ami
    Production from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFantasy SFX for Particle Distort Texture
    Effect Library by Moonflower Carnivore from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFast UI
    Sounds - Sound Effects by AD Sounds from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nMonster Roars
    - Audio Pack by VoiceBosch from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nRPG Essentials Sound
    Effects - FREE! by leohpaz from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSci-fi Guns SFX Pack
    by Mikael Vanninen from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nCybernetic Onslaught (Aggressive
    Heavy Metal for Gaming & Action) by NickPanek from Pixabay.com/music\n\nCharacters
    & Animation & VFX:\\n\nThank you, your models survived our code. That alone deserves
    an applause.\\n\\n\nDragon for Boss Monster:PBR by Dungeon Mason from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nEgypt
    Pack by OpenLab from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFREE-32 RPG Animations by Blink
    from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFree Fire VFX - URP by Vefects from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nHit
    Effects FREE by Matthew Guz from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nHumanoid Robot Avatar
    Set - Mecanim Compatible by LB3D from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nInsectoid Crab
    Monster:Lurker of the Shores(20 Animations) by LB3D from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nMagic
    Effects FREE by Hovl Studio from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nProcedural Fire by
    Hovl Studio from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSci-Fi Drones by Lukas Bobor from assetstore.unity.com\\n\n\n\nLevel
    Design Resources:\\n\nThank you, you gave us props & enviroments that helped
    us transform empty space into this awesome game. \\n\\n\nCity Voxel Pack by PoeMe
    from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFirst Aid Jar by SIUP from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFree
    Industrial building/Garage by Reinforcedcc from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFree
