    Cars by Duane's Mind from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSci-Fi guns|Plug and Play
    by The Developer Train from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSimple Keys by 3Digitalis
    from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nTower Defense Sci-Fi Turret (FREE) by Firazdo from
    assetstore.unity.com\\n\nVending Machines - Lowpoly 3D Pixel Art Pack by F____
    Up Design from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nAmmoBox by BeatHeart Creative Studio
    from assetstore.unity.com\\n\n\nPromotional Video intro's made with Adobe Firefly\n
    \n\nMade with <3 in Unity\\n\n\xA9 2025 Savage Legends"
